d=\"M4 7.5 12 3l8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5z\"></path><path d=\"m4 7.5 8 4.5 8-4.5M12 12v9\"></path></svg>Package <code>dji.sdk.keyvalue.value.camera</code><button class=\"ifm-mini-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"dji.sdk.keyvalue.value.camera\" aria-label=\"Copy package name\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M16 8V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path></svg></button></span><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"></path></svg>Android · Java / Kotlin</span></div><h5 id=\"Description\" style=\"display: none;\">Description:</h5>\n<p style=\"display: none;\"><font color=\"#666\">Storage settings for taking pictures or recording videos. You can choose the lens you need to take pictures, record and store.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"ifm-members-section\" id=\"ifm-members-nav\"><div class=\"ifm-section-head\"><h2>Members</h2><span class=\"ifm-section-note\"><span class=\"ifm-count\">4</span> members</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-tools\"><div class=\"ifm-member-search\"><svg class=\"ifm-search-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-3.4-3.4\"></path></svg><input type=\"search\" id=\"ifm-search\" placeholder=\"Filter by name, parameter or description\" aria-label=\"Filter members\"><button class=\"ifm-search-clear\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Clear search\" hidden=\"\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"ifm-filter-group\"><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"all\" aria-pressed=\"true\">All</button><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"method\">Method</button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-groups\" id=\"ifm-groups\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"method\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>Method</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">4</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_getrequestcurrentscreen_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"getrequestcurrentscreen true means to store the media files generated by the current live video stream when taking pictures or recording videos.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getRequestCurrentScreen</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">true means to store the media files generated by the current live video stream when taking pictures or recording videos.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_setrequestcurrentscreen_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"setrequestcurrentscreen to set whether to store the media file generated by the current live video stream when taking a picture or recording a video.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">setRequestCurrentScreen</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">To set whether to store the media file generated by the current live video stream when taking a picture or recording a video.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_getcameravideostreamsources_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"getcameravideostreamsources to get the list of shooting video source types that need to store media files.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getCameraVideoStreamSources</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">To get the list of shooting video source types that need to store media files.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_setcameravideostreamsources_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"setcameravideostreamsources to set lens video source type that needs to store media files.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">setCameraVideoStreamSources</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">To set lens video source type that needs to store media files.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"ifm-empty-state\" id=\"ifm-empty\" style=\"display:none\">No matching members. Try a shorter keyword.</div></div>\n<h4 id=\"Members\">Members</h4>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_getrequestcurrentscreen\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_getrequestcurrentscreen_inline\">getRequestCurrentScreen</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_getrequestcurrentscreen_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getRequestCurrentScreen</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getRequestCurrentScreen</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.sdk.keyvalue.value.camera</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\"><code>true</code> means to store the media files generated by the current live video stream when taking pictures or recording videos. You can get the video source type of the current live video stream through <code><a href=\"Key_Camera_CameraKey.html#key_camera_cameravideostreamsource\">KeyCameraVideoStreamSource</a></code>. <br> Notice：<br> If it is in the camera mode, the stored photo is the photo of the video source of the current lens, but in the split-screen mode <code><a href=\"DJIValue.html#value_camera_enum_cameradisplaymode_pip\">PIP</a></code> of the infrared lens, it is a screenshot of the image transmission.<br> If it is in recording mode, the stored video is the image transmitted by the current lens, not a high-definition video.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">boolean</font></code></td><td>true means to store the media files generated by the current live video stream when taking pictures or recording videos.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_setrequestcurrentscreen\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_setrequestcurrentscreen_inline\">setRequestCurrentScreen</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_setrequestcurrentscreen_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>setRequestCurrentScreen</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">CameraStreamSettingsInfo</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">setRequestCurrentScreen</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">requestCurrentScreen</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.sdk.keyvalue.value.camera</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">To set whether to store the media file generated by the current live video stream when taking a picture or recording a video. You can get the video source type of the current live video stream through <code><a href=\"Key_Camera_CameraKey.html#key_camera_cameravideostreamsource\">KeyCameraVideoStreamSource</a></code>. Notice：<br> If it is in the camera mode, the stored photo is the photo of the video source of the current lens, but in the split-screen mode <code><a href=\"DJIValue.html#value_camera_enum_cameradisplaymode_pip\">PIP</a></code> of the infrared lens, it is a screenshot of the image transmission.<br> If it is in recording mode, the stored video is the image transmitted by the current lens, not a high-definition video.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>requestCurrentScreen</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> </code></span></td><td>true means to store the media file generated by the current live video stream when taking a picture or recording a video.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"Value_Camera_Struct_MSDKCameraStreamSettings.html#value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings\">CameraStreamSettingsInfo</a></font></code></td><td>Return this.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_getcameravideostreamsources\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_getcameravideostreamsources_inline\">getCameraVideoStreamSources</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_getcameravideostreamsources_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getCameraVideoStreamSources</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">List</span><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">&lt;</span><span class=\"jv-type\">CameraVideoStreamSourceType</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getCameraVideoStreamSources</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.sdk.keyvalue.value.camera</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">To get the list of shooting video source types that need to store media files.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">List&lt;<a href=\"DJIValue.html#value_camera_enum_cameravideostreamsourcetype\">CameraVideoStreamSourceType</a>&gt;</font></code></td><td>Return the list of shooting video source types that need to store media files.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_setcameravideostreamsources\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_setcameravideostreamsources_inline\">setCameraVideoStreamSources</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_setcameravideostreamsources_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>setCameraVideoStreamSources</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">CameraStreamSettingsInfo</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">setCameraVideoStreamSources</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">List</span><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">&lt;</span><span class=\"jv-type\">CameraVideoStreamSourceType</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">cameraVideoStreamSources</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.sdk.keyvalue.value.camera</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">To set lens video source type that needs to store media files. It can be set to store multiple lens video sources.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>cameraVideoStreamSources</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">List</span><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">&lt;</span><a href=\"DJIValue.html#value_camera_enum_cameravideostreamsourcetype\"><span class=\"jv-type\">CameraVideoStreamSourceType</span></a><span class=\"jv-punct\">&gt;</span> </code></span></td><td>Lens video source type that needs to store media files.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"Value_Camera_Struct_MSDKCameraStreamSettings.html#value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings\">CameraStreamSettingsInfo</a></font></code></td><td>Return this.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n\n        </font></font></font></font></font></div><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\">\n      </font></font></font>","tocHtml":"\n        <div class=\"site-toc-inner\">\n          <div class=\"site-toc-title\">On this page</div>\n          <ul data-static-toc=\"true\" class=\"site-toc-list\"><li><a hr